{"id":"a8591aa671cf9030","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-composite.md","title":"Composite","display":"df-composite — Composite","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-composite","aliases":["58-df-composite"],"display":"df-composite — Composite","depends_on":["[[58-df-composition-operator]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-composite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-composite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-composite — Composite"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a2ef5ac555fe2963\" href=\"?note=a2ef5ac555fe2963\" title=\"58-df-composition-operator\">58-df-composition-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in V\">\\(A,B,C\\in V\\)</span> (sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g,h\\in V\">\\(f,g,h\\in V\\)</span> (function graphs and composite candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function-graph predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Composite}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Composite}_S\\)</span> (composite predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}composite} \\vdash \\mathrm{Composite}_S(h,g,f,A,B,C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,B,C)\\land h=\\{\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in A\\times C:\\exists b\\in B\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in g)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}composite} \\vdash \\mathrm{Composite}_S(h,g,f,A,B,C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,B,C)\\land h=\\{\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in A\\times C:\\exists b\\in B\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in g)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The composite is related to a candidate set only after the two input graphs have matching typed domain and codomain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"a2ef5ac555fe2963","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-composition-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"f,g,h\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Composite}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}composite} \\vdash \\mathrm{Composite}_S(h,g,f,A,B,C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,B,C)\\land h=\\{\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in A\\times C:\\exists b\\in B\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in g)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":867,"backlinks":[{"id":"7c0eb208441d0c3e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a4239c0a6290ab42","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"71b8200ebae58c4d","